								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=748.msg12307#msg12307"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
