								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							haha that’s the best you can come up with? Retard? <br /><br />I hate to break it to ya TFA; I could give a shit who you really are. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /> <br />But, if you’re going to come here and flip shit at people have the fucking balls to do it with your eq handle.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br />I never claimed to be nice and respectable; I&#039;m just as judgmental as you. See, that’s why I think your imaginary girl friend is a whore. It’s not so much that she’s a whore, but more that she&#039;s dammed ugly. <br /><br />It&#039;s not my problem that you have to try to prove how un-lonely you are by linking pictures.&nbsp; HEY LOOK EVERYONE!! LOOK!! LOOK!!<br /><br /> (I still call bullshit.)<br /><br />Not everyone in the world is the same; we all don&#039;t link pictures of our &quot;girlfriends&quot; on a everquest forum.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />Keep coming back though, If anything your posts are amusing<br />
